    "bodyStart": "(316) 210-1900 A shining home starts with us – relax while we do the cleaning! Learn More × Our Cleaning Services A Detail-Focused Clean You Can Rely On. Want a freshly cleaned home and a little more free time to enjoy your day? Call Jenny Maids today for expert home cleaning services. Get a Free Quote House Cleaning in Wichita, KS — Maid Clean Every Time Sparkly Shiny Surfaces Smiling Back At You Keeping your home clean shouldn’t feel like another job. Jenny Maids provides reliable, professional house cleaning in Wichita, KS and surrounding communities—so you can enjoy a home that feels fresh, comfortable, and truly taken care of. Whether you need a one-time deep clean or a recurring maid service, our team delivers consistent results you can see and feel every time we visit. Get Your Free Quote Today Our Cleaning Services At Jenny Maids, we make cleaning simple. No contracts, no hassle—just dependable service you can count on. We clean your home with attention to detail, from everyday surfaces to the spots that often get missed. We also offer light office cleaning. If you need commercial services, just let us know—we’re happy to customize a plan for you. Basic Cleaning Perfect for"
